<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan 40-day NCDs average yield at 4.95 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan 40-day NCDs average yield at 4.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$10 billion in 40-day negotiable certificates of deposits on Saturday at an average yield of 4.95 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the bids was between 4.93 and 4.97 percent.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$21 billion.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
